      "content": "hey, i'm about 34 weeks pregnant and just noticed my hands and face look kinda puffy today... even my rings feel tight lol. plus i keep seeing these little flickers of light in my eyes every now and then. i'm probably just exhausted from carrying this extra weight, right? bit worried but probably just normal pregnancy stuff.",
